     9| *   - SignalWire: IVX_TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID (Project ID) + IVX_TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN (API token) + IVX_TWILIO_API_HOST=ivxholding.signalwire.com
    10| *   - IVX_TWILIO_MESSAGING_SERVICE_SID (preferred — uses the ivxholding.com service)
    11| *   - IVX_TWILIO_FROM_PHONE (fallback if no messaging service configured)
    12| *
    13| * Marker: ivx-twilio-sms-2026-08-12
    14| */
    15|
    16|import { normalizePhoneToE164 } from './ivx-sns-sms';
