     1|/**
     2| * IVX Autonomous SMS Notifier — sends owner status updates via AWS SNS.
     3| *
     4| * Wired into the autonomous scheduler tick. Every 2 hours, sends a concise
     5| * status SMS to the owner's phone (IVX_OWNER_RECOVERY_PHONE) with:
     6| *   - 12-IA agent active count
     7| *   - Factory agent pending/active count
     8| *   - Queue depth
